{"tweet_id": "2056774160852845047", "datetime": "2026-05-19T19:29:07", "date_label": "19 May 19:29", "locked": false, "text": "Kerim;  \nlook, I'm telling the story straight through you.\n\nBiden's leaving and you're getting elected president,  \ngot it? \n\nYou're defending #bitcoin or #kripto  \nwe're agreed, right? \n\nYou're shouting #bitcoin but,  \nyou can't hype up the market.\n\nYou know why? \n\nThe PRESIDENT before you gave him the ETF.  \nIn other words, put chains on it. \n\nDidn't leave you a free market like in the old days. \n\nHow was it back then?\n\nThe moment you said #BİTCOİN the market would soar.", "products": ["BTC"], "tip": ["tez"], "kayit_tipi": "yorum", "lang": "tr", "analyzed": true, "is_quote": false, "quoted_by": null, "quote_of": null, "quote_stub": false, "thread_root": null, "fiyat": "—", "sonra": "—", "sonuc": "yorum", "baglanti": "", "media_urls": [], "media_files": [], "abone_metin": false, "abone_donemi": true, "abone_ozel": false}
